        "left": "pdu->token + pdu->alloc_size",
        "right": "&pdu->token[0]"
      },
      "verified": true,
      "verified_by": "a_sink_probe_reads_at_or_past_alloc_end",
      "fine_trace_step": 11,
      "description": "Crash sink. The extended-token branch dereferences the first token byte even though the accepted WSS packet had no bytes after its two-byte header, so `pdu->token[0]` is one byte past the heap buffer allocated by `coap_pdu_init(..., 0)`."
    }
